@startuml

autonumber
skinparam actorStyle awesome

title "Manage Subscriptions and Notification Templates"

actor Admin

participant "UI" as ui
participant "Subscription API" as api
participant "Acumatica ERP Auth" as auth
database "Subscription DB" as db

== Authentication & Authorization (applies to all requests) ==

Admin -> ui : Open admin management
ui -> api : Request subscriptions/templates

api -> auth : Validate session / resolve user_id
auth --> api : identity confirmed

api -> auth : Verify admin role / authorize access
auth --> api : role = ADMIN confirmed

note right of api
All subsequent requests in this flow
require:
- session validation
- admin role authorization
end note

== Read data ==

api -> db : Load all subscriptions + templates
db --> api : Return data
api --> ui : Display management view

== Manage Template ==

Admin -> ui : Create / update template
ui -> api : POST/PUT template

api -> db : Save template changes
db --> api : Confirm persistence
api --> ui : Success response

== Manage Subscription ==

Admin -> ui : Create / update subscription
ui -> api : POST/PUT subscription

api -> db : Save subscription changes
db --> api : Confirm persistence
api --> ui : Success response

@enduml